{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_ansel_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_ansel_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"身為醫者","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_ansel_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"0f79cf321c04a1d521aa9a4477ca099aa18fe574b73532a4772712f683c51172","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"就這些嗎，安賽爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，下個月A4預備小隊的任務目的地就是鐵腕城，所以，不用麻煩你從家鄉帶什麼東西回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，可是……你不給你的家人寄幾封信回去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒關係的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把這封給我朋友的信帶到就可以了，恩加拉會幫我出主意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對了，只有那個大包裹是給他的，這小盒的消炎藥是給你的，在野外被蟲獸咬了的話會很有用，不要忘記拿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈哈，要是撞見你的家人，我會很難辦啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"那我出發了，安賽爾，多謝啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也該繼續做準備了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g4_rmbtwild_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安德切爾","speakerId":"char_211_adnach","isRemote":false,"text":"玫蘭莎，我現在看不見你了，提供不了火力掩護！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安德切爾","speakerId":"char_211_adnach","isRemote":false,"text":"東北方向又有兩隻小鉗獸過來了！卡緹，不能衝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安德切爾","speakerId":"char_211_adnach","isRemote":false,"text":"遵照安賽爾規劃的醫療支援線！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡緹","speakerId":"char_209_ardign","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我不會讓安賽爾為難的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡緹","speakerId":"char_209_ardign","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——哼哼，聞到了！氣味引誘劑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡緹","speakerId":"char_209_ardign","isRemote":false,"text":"玫蘭莎，控制這些鉗獸的馴獸師絕對就在東北方向，說不好就躲在那個礦場黑乎乎的入口裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"了解了。史都華德……往後撤，這邊交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以幫安賽爾照顧一下護送目標嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請躺下，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"躺下？開什麼玩笑？醫生，帶我們回載具！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"你是眼瞎了看不到那些蟲子和鉗獸，還是聽不到榴彈爆炸的聲音？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請相信我的隊友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這位置下，我能夠及時支援他們，他們也會比載具的鐵皮更好地保護我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你確定？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"——噫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刺傷您的鉗獸有毒性，請保持鎮靜，躺下減緩血液流速，並儘快接受處理。這樣也能避免您的中樞神經受到無法挽回的損害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用太擔心，我有攜帶對應的解毒血清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"……好吧，我聽你的，醫生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"……你真的沒弄錯？萬一你認錯了鉗獸的種類，你、你要怎麼賠我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會的，我很熟悉雷姆必拓的自然生物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，請放鬆……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，醫、醫生，過來了，那邊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安賽爾，低頭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"靠近的威脅我已經處理掉了，那邊還有一名傷員，我背到安全的位置了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，稍微等我一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，注射完成了，您可以再休息一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來我會去治療您隊伍中的其他傷員。醫療處理全部完成之後，我們會按任務需求繼續護送各位的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"……醫生，有沒有人說過，以你的年紀，你冷靜得有點……令人害怕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我只是盡力專注於自己能做到的事情而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"但你很了不起。你一定救過很多人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"安賽爾，情況如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"……怎麼突然這麼低落？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能量補充營養劑在包裡。我馬上幫你處理傷口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我竟然一下子走神了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，這說明你的隊友們值得你信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事，一點擦傷而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你……你自己有抽空補充能量嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉，自從回到雷姆必拓，你就一直這樣，白天執行任務，晚上堅持輪值夜班，還常常忘記照顧自己的身體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"不是有好幾個幹員說過要換你的夜班嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是習慣了上夜班的生活節奏嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在想，身為醫生，我值得其他人的稱讚嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得，我有救到足夠多的人嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g4_embassy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"檢查結果出來了，玫蘭莎，不用擔心。大家都防護得很好，沒有在任務中受傷，也沒有感染加重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天早上我會告訴大家……欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼都還沒睡？快去睡覺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其是卡緹，你是不是忘記明天我們還要去源石製品加工廠了？小心又在會議室裡睡著！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡緹","speakerId":"char_209_ardign","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我們的雷姆必拓奇怪零食試吃大會還沒結束呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡緹","speakerId":"char_209_ardign","isRemote":false,"text":"砂糖木瓜葉卷、羽獸卵酥炸蒲公英……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來這個零食，芙蓉反覆強調不利於血糖健康、安賽爾真心建議不好吃不要吃但自己定期進貨，誰想試試？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安德切爾","speakerId":"char_211_adnach","isRemote":false,"text":"聽了這種介紹，我想沒有人會拒絕的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"——鐵腕城雜牌手工薄荷糖，你也來一顆吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"你今天說的那些事，確實很讓人為難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"設身處地想想，如果我是你的話，肯定也會站在家門口猶豫要不要進去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"“如果你不接我的班，我怎麼能叫後繼有人呢？”……你大伯的這句話，真的很難回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"——不過，你也不能因此就不好好休息啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安德切爾","speakerId":"char_211_adnach","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。也許你能夠這樣向大伯證明，自己是個有業績的好醫生，但是從此以後，你讓我們注意身體的時候，會變得很沒有說服力哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好吧，我吃完宵夜就去休息！真的！我真的不會再在樓梯上昏倒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡緹","speakerId":"char_209_ardign","isRemote":false,"text":"玫蘭莎，你說這次我們能相信安賽爾嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……相信一次吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡緹","speakerId":"char_209_ardign","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，安賽爾，那我們先走啦！從樓梯上摔下去的話要叫我哦，在你滾到最底下之前我就能跑出來接住你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡緹","speakerId":"char_209_ardign","isRemote":false,"text":"安賽爾是不是到現在還以為我們不知道，卡特斯根本不是天生喜歡熬夜的種族！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，讓他晚上偷偷地多吃點也沒什麼不好，不然他的身體根本撐不住體能訓練……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——您好，這裡是羅德島駐雷姆必拓鐵腕城辦事處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你好，我找……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不對，安賽爾，那邊接電話的就是安賽爾，對吧！我一聽就知道！你終於到啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——恩加拉？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有多久沒聽到你的聲音了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你會讓信使捎個消息回來，告訴我你什麼時候有空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我看到黃頁上有登記你們公司的電話，就找了個公共電話亭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪間電話亭？你家旁邊那個貼滿卡通貼紙的？精煉廠門口那個被火燒過的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是，不是，這邊的路已經翻新啦。別著急，過幾天我帶你看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知道我現在就想衝出門？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我還能不了解你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，聽到你這麼精神，我就放心了。看來你的公司對你不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你記得嗎？前兩年你去實習的時候，我們根本找不到你那家公司的相關資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那時我還很擔心，黃頁上可是連我家樓下雜貨店的聯絡方式都能查到，這家公司會不會是什麼騙局？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你啊，自從在醫科學校學到了綠葉菜罐頭其實不能讓人體質強壯之後，就對外來的許多東西都疑神疑鬼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，別說了……我真的滿懷希望地吃了好多年綠葉菜罐頭，發現它是騙局實在是對我打擊太大了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……畢竟，足球也好工廠跑酷也好，就算滾鐵桶都好，小時候的我真的很想參與到某個集體活動裡去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過多少次了？我的夢想就是像你那樣，從小就長得高大，有力氣，幫家裡做很多事也不會累。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但事實上，我只是跟著大家跑幾分鐘，就會頭暈眼花，喘不過氣，只能站在場邊當觀眾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是你最初提議給我一個喇叭，讓我在旁邊充當解說，我大概就會一直孤零零地站在場邊吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那次大家約好晚上從家裡溜出來，一起去礦渣場看我們礦區的代表隊跟隔壁礦區的人比賽拔河。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礦渣場的射燈又白又刺眼，大家都在喊口號加油，我拿著小筆記本，專心地記那些我覺得很酷的口號和解說詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，現在看起來都傻透了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，抱歉，信裡反反覆覆提過那麼多次的事情，我怎麼一打電話又滔滔不絕地說起來了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……恩加拉？你怎麼不說話了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……啊，沒事。沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……是不是有哪裡不舒服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我寄給你的藥，你有準時吃嗎？前幾次說的礦石病病情自我判斷標準，你記住了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你什麼時候有空？沒有辦法去醫院準確檢測的情況下，至少我可以先做基礎判斷……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……噗，哈哈哈哈！別著急，安賽爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你自己的身體狀況怎麼樣啦？那個……什麼貧血來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我嗎？我的情況沒什麼好擔心的。雖然現在已經弄清楚了是不能根治的先天性疾病，但好在我表現出來的只是輕度症狀……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸，醫生啊，聽說我得了礦石病的時候，你可不是這麼說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“只是以現在的手段還不能根治”，這麼說是不是準確一點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你想用自己的醫術多救一些人，向你大伯證明自己在做的事情很有價值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是你這小子一開始學醫，難道不是為了救自己嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別把自己壓垮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……或許確實是因為回到家鄉，想到我做的每一件事情都可能與我的親人朋友有關，所以我太急切了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，別那麼擔心。就像你一直以來那樣，專注於自己能做的事情就好，剩下的就交給你的好朋友們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們明晚見吧，還是老地方，一起吃宵夜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不確定……真的是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，羅德島的各位，我還是很難認同你們提供的這幾種礦石病抑製藥的價值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，你們也看到了，工人們的防護服以及兩條流水線，都是新的。我們暫時沒有升級設備，增加礦石病防護措施的打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的這份方案，價格太高，有太多我們不需要的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請等一等，女士……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經講解很多次了，不需要再重複了，醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的商談就到這裡吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"……她說的不對，安賽爾，他們目前提供給工人的購藥管道並不可靠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"可是……安賽爾你給出了那麼專業的說明，為什麼還是說服不了他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是難免的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在雷姆必拓，很多時候，大家最相信的是祖輩的經驗和鄰居之間的口碑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其是醫療方面，自然對雷姆必拓人很嚴苛，但雷姆必拓發展起來的醫療水準卻不理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，甚至有“不是重病不用見醫生”的誤會……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都想自己在家解決一些小毛病，結果，就總是會些奇怪的靈藥在一個區域裡突然流行起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一開始，我就做好了這樣的心理準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但我還是覺得……有些可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡緹","speakerId":"char_209_ardign","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，我記得，安賽爾聽說這家公司有合作意向的時候，高興了好久呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡緹","speakerId":"char_209_ardign","isRemote":false,"text":"做了許多準備，也努力周旋物流之類的第三方，想降低方案成本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我是有一些私心的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣一家雷姆必拓的大型公司，往往包括了數萬名工人。我很難不去想像，這些獲得礦石病防護保障的人當中有我的親友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很想證明，自己成為醫生是有價值的，我能為他們做些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……很可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，安賽爾……今天結束了，但是，我們可以明天再來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你每次都會做的那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡緹","speakerId":"char_209_ardign","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊是啊，你如果相信自己是對的，就會堅持到說服對方為止，不是嗎？我還以為你剛剛就會追上對方繼續講道理呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡緹","speakerId":"char_209_ardign","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，是安賽爾你自己說的，想救更多的人。救人應該不能算私心吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g3_rmbttown"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安賽爾。唐尼大叔的這張報告單，你看得懂嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……臟器有異常陰影，合併肺部問題，這張造影結果顯示……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"總之，是礦石病，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是的，大伯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你有辦法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我建議過他不要再下礦了，可是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是所有人都像你一樣有選擇的餘地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也希望你能做出正確的選擇。選擇自己該做的事情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……或許只是太熟悉這塊土地了，所以害怕自己再怎麼努力也做不了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我要去見一位中學時的朋友，你們先回辦事處吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g3_rmbttown"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，就像恩加拉說的一樣，這裡的舊電話亭也被翻新了……噗。新的這個是想漆成胡蘿蔔的顏色嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雜貨店的小窗戶還是蹭滿了黑漆漆的機油。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不知道恩加拉還喜不喜歡喝汽水，先給他買一瓶吧……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……求藥的人也還是會在走投無路的時候去聯絡黑市，是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，請聽我說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位先生，您是想要治療礦石病的藥物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嗯，是的……我的同伴非常需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他就在那邊，可是他起不來了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"順著對方手指的方向，安賽爾看到一個熟悉的身影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘶……沒事的，安賽爾，它只會疼一小會兒，是那個工友太小題大作了。\n不用花時間操心我的事情，好不容易見面，你還沒跟我講你旅遊去過的地方呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"別緊張，不是只有大病才會去看醫生嗎？我覺得我還好，也不是很痛。\n比我病重的工友那麼多，許多人還有另一半和小孩……我就把藥給他們了啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你還別說，你們公司的藥真的有用，好幾個人誇過了。安賽爾，你真的可以為自己在做的事驕傲一下，反正我可驕傲了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡緹","speakerId":"char_209_ardign","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛那個人……是安賽爾的朋友嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡緹","speakerId":"char_209_ardign","isRemote":false,"text":"他看起來狀況好差……脫掉外套之後，手臂和胸口都能看到不少裸露的源石結晶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安德切爾","speakerId":"char_211_adnach","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，他似乎意識很清醒。也就是說，不是急性感染發作，而是慢性發展到了這一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安德切爾","speakerId":"char_211_adnach","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉，我稍微有點能理解安賽爾為什麼那麼想當個醫生，他的家人又為什麼那麼不樂意了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"安賽爾……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……檢查結果出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安德切爾","speakerId":"char_211_adnach","isRemote":false,"text":"很難對當事人開口的話，我們一起幫你矇騙過去，也不是不行哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用……我已經對他說過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他早就做好心理準備了。這邊的礦區和其他地方不同，感染者會集中起來繼續工作，他應該……目睹過很多類似的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他就是太習慣這一切了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我能早一點回來看看……要是我告訴他如何判斷病情、注意何時用藥的時候言辭再嚴厲一點……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我想過，痛覺判斷本來就因人而異，或者，要是我能改變大家只有病重才就醫的觀念……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是雷姆必拓的醫療水準再好一些，對礦石病的防護意識再完善一些……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……現在病情已經從中期向晚期發展了。到了這個階段，我知道的任何抑制手段，都不再有效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許兩年，也許一年……我沒辦法拖延更久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安德切爾","speakerId":"char_211_adnach","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，安賽爾……我很想幫助你，或者安慰你，但是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不，不，對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不該跟你們說這些話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……明明一直是我身體虛弱受人照顧，為什麼先被病魔擊倒的卻是別人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g3_rmbttown"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩加拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別拖著我跑了，安賽爾，我真怕你下一秒就昏倒在大街上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安德切爾","speakerId":"char_211_adnach","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我又改良了一次我的弩，畢竟現在我的力量增強了嘛。這樣，我能在更遠的地方支援你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"我能抓住那種源石技藝的尾巴……不要擔心，安賽爾，我的感染程度沒有加深。我覺得，我只是更了解它了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題，我一個人……去突襲。有芙蘭卡小姐的指導，我的劍，沒那麼柔軟，我也不會那麼容易被打倒……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，實習醫生安賽爾。目前羅德島對礦石病的研究是比較先進的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但迄今為止，我們能得出的也僅有這一結論：我們還無法阻止礦石病的蔓延，只能從死亡手中為患者搶來時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然，你的志向是外科醫生的話，或許和礦石病直接打交道的時間會比較少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，既然是醫生，那我們能做的事情總是差不多的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只能一次一次告訴死亡，不是今天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我……也根本沒有選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做不到的事，我救不了的人……我不承認。絕不能承認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“只是還不是今天。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"avg_212_ansel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能這麼說……作為一名醫生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_208_melan","aliases":["玫蘭莎"]},{"speakerId":"char_209_ardign","aliases":["卡緹"]},{"speakerId":"char_210_stward","aliases":["史都華德"]},{"speakerId":"char_211_adnach","aliases":["安德切爾"]}]}
